1
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:49,520
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:51,400
=Episode 16=

3
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:54,560
Promise me you'll live. For both of us.

4
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:55,759
(My sister and I)

5
00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:57,679
(once naively believed)

6
00:00:58,960 --> 00:01:01,240
(that we would finally escape the abuse)

7
00:01:02,159 --> 00:01:03,880
(and endless wandering.)

8
00:01:04,879 --> 00:01:09,599
(Yet we fell into a den of evil
that cost us everything.)

9
00:01:12,599 --> 00:01:15,040
(What did we ever do wrong?)

10
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:22,719
This is the truth.

11
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:27,120
Your so‑called godfather,

12
00:01:28,079 --> 00:01:30,000
those so‑called righteous officials,

13
00:01:30,599 --> 00:01:32,840
they are beasts wearing human skin.

14
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:37,439
But you made a deal with a demon.

15
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:39,040
You've done terrible things.

16
00:01:40,239 --> 00:01:41,680
This will only destroy you.

17
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:44,719
Those girls they destroyed...

18
00:01:45,439 --> 00:01:47,920
some dead, some driven mad.

19
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:50,000
Their lives were ruined forever.

20
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:52,702
The moment my sister and I

21
00:01:52,703 --> 00:01:54,400
were taken by them,

22
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:57,480
I was already dead inside.

23
00:01:58,359 --> 00:01:59,239
Stop this.

24
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:01,439
You promised your sister.

25
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:03,159
You promised to live for her.

26
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:05,480
My sister is gone.

27
00:02:06,079 --> 00:02:07,760
She's never coming back.

28
00:02:08,439 --> 00:02:10,120
It took me ten years

29
00:02:10,199 --> 00:02:11,700
to track down

30
00:02:11,700 --> 00:02:12,879
every last one of those animals.

31
00:02:13,479 --> 00:02:15,560
Since this world won't give me justice,

32
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:18,479
I'll take it myself.

33
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:21,560
I'll make them live in constant fear.

34
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:24,000
Even death won't give them peace.

35
00:02:25,719 --> 00:02:27,759
We won't let you kill anyone else.

36
00:02:28,879 --> 00:02:30,639
You think you can stop me?

37
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:39,520
This is Yushi's Bloodthirsty Gu.

38
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:44,360
Yushi is the most powerful
of the Four Demonesses.

39
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:45,680
Why is she here?

40
00:02:46,039 --> 00:02:47,319
So the Bloodskin is...

41
00:02:47,319 --> 00:02:48,840
The Gu fed on their flesh and blood.

42
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:52,520
Once inside a host, Yushi's Gus
transform them into demons.

43
00:02:53,479 --> 00:02:55,319
Doctor Lin, if this continues,

44
00:02:55,319 --> 00:02:56,599
you will become a demon.

45
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:58,639
Human.

46
00:02:59,879 --> 00:03:00,680
Demon.

47
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:03,120
I don't care.

48
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:05,479
As long as I can expose those beasts

49
00:03:05,479 --> 00:03:07,360
who wear human skin,

50
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:09,800
no girl in this world

51
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:11,639
will ever suffer
what my sister and I did.

52
00:03:12,319 --> 00:03:14,120
Even if I become her vessel,

53
00:03:15,039 --> 00:03:16,400
I'll take that risk.

54
00:03:18,879 --> 00:03:20,479
Perfect.

55
00:03:21,319 --> 00:03:23,960
My little Gu are hungry too.

56
00:03:25,199 --> 00:03:27,879
Go on, enjoy your feast,

57
00:03:28,039 --> 00:03:29,360
little ones.

58
00:03:36,159 --> 00:03:37,000
Oh no.

59
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:38,274
She's sending all these Gus

60
00:03:38,500 --> 00:03:39,919
into the capital!

61
00:04:02,199 --> 00:04:03,000
Hmph.

62
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:05,039
Look at yourself.

63
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:07,719
Falling in love with a lowly human.

64
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:09,719
It's beneath you.

65
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:11,680
Human or demon, it's just a shell.

66
00:04:11,879 --> 00:04:12,960
Only love can overcome all barriers.

67
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:15,280
You will never understand.

68
00:04:16,839 --> 00:04:19,079
All this talk of love and affection,

69
00:04:19,399 --> 00:04:20,879
it makes me sick.

70
00:04:21,439 --> 00:04:23,279
My only purpose is to serve my master.

71
00:04:23,879 --> 00:04:25,800
That's what gives my life meaning.

72
00:04:26,399 --> 00:04:28,120
Yu Linjun sent you.

73
00:04:28,519 --> 00:04:29,720
You think...

74
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:30,480
Hmph!

75
00:04:37,879 --> 00:04:41,040
My master would never
send just one of us.

76
00:05:12,519 --> 00:05:14,079
Just the blood of the Divine Stone

77
00:05:14,399 --> 00:05:16,240
can boost one's cultivation this much.

78
00:05:16,879 --> 00:05:18,759
I will use the Divine Stone's blood

79
00:05:19,279 --> 00:05:19,700
to kill that old man

80
00:05:19,700 --> 00:05:22,120
who's holding the Sky Rift shut.

81
00:05:22,639 --> 00:05:24,680
The Yuanzhen Sect's barrier is broken.

82
00:05:24,959 --> 00:05:26,160
After the Sky Rift cracks,

83
00:05:26,319 --> 00:05:28,639
the Void Realm will descend
upon the mortal world.

84
00:05:29,079 --> 00:05:30,759
My master's great wish
will be fulfilled.

85
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:33,600
If you so much as touch my master,

86
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:36,079
I will destroy you.

87
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:47,399
No.

88
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:48,854
My Divine Stone power

89
00:05:48,855 --> 00:05:50,319
has been sealed.

90
00:05:53,839 --> 00:05:55,600
Not just the Stone's power.

91
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:58,160
Your demon powers are sealed too.

92
00:05:58,759 --> 00:06:00,000
Right now, you're nothing

93
00:06:00,439 --> 00:06:03,240
more than an ordinary mortal.

94
00:06:17,279 --> 00:06:18,920
- Master!
- Master! Master!

95
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:20,279
Master!

96
00:06:21,959 --> 00:06:22,879
Master, are you all right?

97
00:06:24,839 --> 00:06:26,680
Master gave his life to seal the Rift.

98
00:06:27,319 --> 00:06:28,759
On top of that,
he was attacked by demons.

99
00:06:30,639 --> 00:06:31,959
I fear his life is already...

100
00:06:32,519 --> 00:06:33,759
What happened here?

101
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:35,639
Ever since we left,

102
00:06:36,079 --> 00:06:38,759
demons kept trying
to break through the barrier

103
00:06:38,759 --> 00:06:39,920
and enter Yuanzhen Sect

104
00:06:40,560 --> 00:06:41,920
to destroy the Sky Rift Seal.

105
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:44,120
But Master...

106
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:48,319
We hunted Zhu Yu all the way,

107
00:06:48,759 --> 00:06:50,680
and struck him down while he was weak,

108
00:06:50,959 --> 00:06:53,360
before he could find a new vessel.

109
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:56,360
Xuanwu Sect will surely come
seeking revenge.

110
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:59,079
Let's take you somewhere safe

111
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:02,240
and tend to his wounds.

112
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:03,199
No need.

113
00:07:04,199 --> 00:07:06,120
I tried to seal the barrier completely,

114
00:07:07,079 --> 00:07:09,199
but even the best plans
have their flaws.

115
00:07:09,879 --> 00:07:10,680
Master,

116
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:13,879
don't worry. We're here.

117
00:07:15,759 --> 00:07:18,680
Having you three as my disciples...

118
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:21,360
it's been enough.

119
00:07:23,639 --> 00:07:26,720
- I have no regrets.
- You can't die!

120
00:07:26,759 --> 00:07:29,160
I'm not ready to lose you!

121
00:07:29,879 --> 00:07:31,560
This was my fate.

122
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:36,160
This is where my path ends.

123
00:07:37,079 --> 00:07:41,079
This is my life's final lesson.

124
00:07:43,199 --> 00:07:44,959
Don't grieve.

125
00:07:47,639 --> 00:07:49,600
My only remaining worry

126
00:07:50,839 --> 00:07:52,560
is that the Sky Rift
is about to tear open.

127
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:55,759
The world will fall into chaos.

128
00:07:59,279 --> 00:08:00,319
Within seven days,

129
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:03,240
you must find the Divine Stone
and mend the sky.

130
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:05,279
Otherwise,

131
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:07,560
the Demon King will descend,

132
00:08:08,519 --> 00:08:10,600
and there will be no light left.

133
00:08:11,439 --> 00:08:12,560
Master, rest assured.

134
00:08:12,879 --> 00:08:14,680
We will seal the Sky Rift.

135
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:16,319
We will not fail you or this world.

136
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:22,160
You are a demon,

137
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:27,639
yet you have more heart
than most humans.

138
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:33,759
Good.

139
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,000
Yuanchu,

140
00:08:38,639 --> 00:08:39,759
you two...

141
00:08:43,039 --> 00:08:43,840
Master,

142
00:08:45,399 --> 00:08:49,159
we have been officially married.

143
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:06,440
Good.

144
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:09,039
Good.

145
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:11,720
Good.

146
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:13,600
Good.

147
00:09:13,879 --> 00:09:14,960
This union...

148
00:09:15,639 --> 00:09:16,960
I give it my blessing.

149
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:19,480
Help me up. Quick.

150
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:23,120
Easy, Master.

151
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,200
Today,

152
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:26,480
I, your master,

153
00:09:27,879 --> 00:09:29,240
will personally

154
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:31,919
officiate your wedding ceremony.

155
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:38,720
Heaven and earth bear witness.

156
00:09:39,799 --> 00:09:43,120
I, master of Yuanzhen,
take my disciple Yuanchu

157
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:47,360
and Shangguan Ziyan
to be husband and wife.

158
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:50,120
From this day forward,

159
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:53,879
may you walk through life together.

160
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:56,559
Through sorrow

161
00:09:57,399 --> 00:09:59,200
and joy, honor and disgrace.

162
00:10:00,679 --> 00:10:03,600
May you remain steadfast and true.

163
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:05,799
Strong and self-reliant.

164
00:10:33,799 --> 00:10:34,600
Mm.

165
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:47,279
Take this.

166
00:10:50,960 --> 00:10:52,399
May the heavens bear witness.

167
00:10:53,039 --> 00:10:55,840
I hereby name you
the new Sect Master of Yuanzhen.

168
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:58,120
Never forget our sect's teachings.

169
00:10:58,960 --> 00:11:01,320
Seek truth. Hold onto goodness.

170
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:04,000
Only then will you find your own way.

171
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:06,639
Yes.

172
00:11:07,480 --> 00:11:08,279
Master.

173
00:11:09,399 --> 00:11:10,279
From now on,

174
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:12,919
do not let your tears fall so easily.

175
00:11:13,919 --> 00:11:15,120
You must become one

176
00:11:15,519 --> 00:11:16,960
who eases the people's suffering

177
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:19,159
and protects the innocent.

178
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:21,120
Do you remember?

179
00:11:22,159 --> 00:11:22,960
Yes, I do.

180
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:29,720
Master!

181
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:30,120
Master!

182
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:30,600
Master!

183
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:31,279
Master!

184
00:11:31,279 --> 00:11:32,080
Master!

185
00:11:32,519 --> 00:11:33,320
Master!

186
00:11:35,279 --> 00:11:35,879
Master!

187
00:11:35,879 --> 00:11:36,679
Master!

188
00:11:45,480 --> 00:11:46,759
Master! Master!

189
00:12:05,440 --> 00:12:08,720
Free from the body,

190
00:12:10,559 --> 00:12:11,879
free from guilt,

191
00:12:14,159 --> 00:12:16,960
follow my heart to immortality

192
00:12:16,960 --> 00:12:22,639
beyond this mortal world.

193
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:32,879
Master!

194
00:12:36,799 --> 00:12:37,600
Master!

195
00:13:05,720 --> 00:13:07,480
If you are from Xuanwu Sect

196
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:10,080
seeking revenge for Zhu Yu,

197
00:13:10,639 --> 00:13:13,039
I, Chi Xiao, will bear it all alone.

198
00:13:13,559 --> 00:13:14,519
By imperial decree,

199
00:13:14,600 --> 00:13:15,399
we are to

200
00:13:15,399 --> 00:13:16,120
arrest the demoness

201
00:13:16,120 --> 00:13:16,919
to mend the sky.

202
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:44,800
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

203
00:13:44,800 --> 00:13:48,200
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

204
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:51,720
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

205
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:55,040
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

206
00:13:55,120 --> 00:14:01,960
♪Let the wind sweep away
this heavy air of sorrow♪

207
00:14:02,560 --> 00:14:09,555
♪Do not forget the tangled paths
that you and I have crossed♪

208
00:14:10,080 --> 00:14:13,800
♪Let towering waves come crashing down;
I'll fight against the tide♪

209
00:14:13,800 --> 00:14:17,640
♪I shatter
the hollow fate they wrote for me♪

210
00:14:17,640 --> 00:14:24,440
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
